Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.68,0:01:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[Verse 2]\\NIt wasn\'t smack, it wasn’t blow,\\NThis shit creeps in quiet and steals the show.\\NYour eyes rolled back, your fists went tight,\\NYou were drowning dry in the pale porch light.\\NYou said, “It’s GBH or maybe G,”\\NBut you were gone before explaining to me.\\NI sat there holding your vacant shell—\\NA front row seat in a private hell.
